  "method": "GO4 (spec \u00a77.2): B0 (option 'ibc', CY2002-05 mean) split into an energy part carried by the gas price gas(y)/gas(2002-05) and a services part carried by CPIH; energy share = NESO 2025 Annual Balancing Costs workbook, FY2018/19 (central). Generators' share included. Range: low = the stacked option 'nao_2005|max' (the engine's central to v4-s32), high = 'ibc|min', each as one rule for every year (chosen on the 2002-2025 total), so in a year where the gas index is below CPIH an option may cross the central.",
